                "The victoria sandwich — always such a favourite tea cake! Tell me about your recipe.",
                "Making a victoria sandwich that rises evenly — such a satisfaction! What is your secret?",
                "A perfectly even victoria sandwich — such a pride! How do you achieve that?"
