        // 6. fond-of-a-good-willow-pattern
        if (normalized.containsAny("a good willow-pattern plate is such a beautiful piece of china", "i have always loved the willow pattern and its legend", "willow-pattern china is so well designed and so timeless", "the blue and white willow pattern is one of the finest designs")) {
