        // 11. fond-of-a-good-hawthorn-hedge
        if (normalized.containsAny("a well-kept hawthorn hedge is one of the finest features of the landscape", "the old hawthorn hedge is such a living wall", "a thick hawthorn hedge gives the most wonderful shelter", "hawthorn hedges have been the backbone of the landscape")) {
            val text = if (isRussian) listOf(
